  <2>17. CASE WriteDoneCompletes(c2)
          BY <2>0, <2>17, SMT DEF  WriteDoneCompletes, L1!WriteDoneReturns,
           ConsumingTerminal, RingHead, RingTail, ManagedTypeOK, L1!TypeOK,
