<1>12. CASE \E cId \in CallIds, msg \in Messages, b \in BufferIds :
             CommitWrite(cId, msg, b)
    BY <1>12, SMT DEF  CommitWrite, BindingMayDowncall, L1!SendMessage,
       L1!L0!SendMessage, PayloadOwed, L1!HostOwnsSomePayload,
