  <2>6. CASE CancelWaitingRead(c2)
          BY <2>0, <2>6, SMT DEF  CancelWaitingRead,
           L1!RequestCallCancellation, L1!L0!IsUnusedCall, PayloadOwed,
           L1!HostOwnsSomePayload, L1!OwedPayloads, RingDrained, RingHead,
