       ConsumerPhaseMatchesDispose, ReadCancelPendingOnlyInFlight,
       ReadInFlight, L1!TypeOK, L1!IndInv, L1!vars, L1!l0_vars,
       L1!ffi_vars, L1!L0!vars, L1!L0!RuntimeVars, L1!L0!ChannelVars,
