             L1!IsReturnedBuffer, NoRetryLen
    <1>7. TokenPublishedBeforeStart'
        BY DEF TokenPublishedBeforeStart, L1!L0!IsUnusedCall
    <1>8. RootSurvivesCallbacks'
        BY SMT DEF RootSurvivesCallbacks, TokenPublishedBeforeStart,
