             L1!L0!RuntimeVars, L1!L0!ChannelVars, L1!L0!CallVars,
             L1!RequestCallCancellation, L1!L0!RuntimeFail
    <1>g3. CancelledParseHasNoPendingRequest'
        BY SMT DEF CancelledParseHasNoPendingRequest, ReadInFlight,
