        BY SMT DEF  LiveCallHasLiveChannel, ChannelSettled,
             AllLeasesReleased, ChannelStateMatchesNative, L1!IndInv,
             L1!TypeOK, L1!L0!TypeOK, l1_vars, L1!vars, L1!l0_vars,
             L1!ffi_vars, L1!L0!vars, L1!L0!RuntimeVars,
